  <standard_solution_key_technique>Coordinate geometry with the constraint a² + b² = 4 (rectangle diagonal = circle diameter), finding E on the perpendicular bisector of AB and the circle, and solving ab = ½a(1 − b/2) to get |AD| = 2/5.</standard_solution_key_technique>
